# Code Quality Limits
RULE: File 900 max (warn 700); function 100 (method 50); class 500; complexity 10; imports 30; params 5; coverage 70% min. All enforced BLOCKING in quality gates.
WHY: Enforced in quality gates; maintains maintainability. Single Responsibility Principle.
CODEX: 06-coding-standards/file-splitting-guide.md, quality-gates-service-template.sh
SSOT TEMPLATE: MAX_FILE_LINES=900; FILE_WARN_LINES=700; MAX_FUNCTION_LINES=100; MAX_CLASS_LINES=500; MAX_METHOD_LINES=50; MIN_COVERAGE=70
DO: Extract helpers; use composition; split files >900 lines (by pipeline stage, domain, or operation); McCabe max-complexity 10
NEVER: Exceed limits without refactor; add to ignore; bypass enforcement; add noqa to bypass
